      "note": "Provisional Panther Lake candidate. SteamOS 3.10 target xe module declares all five paths; its image already contains PTL GuC/HuC/GSC and xe3lpd_dmc, but lacks xe3lpd_3002_dmc. The two DMC alternatives correspond to display IP 3000/3002 and are retained as a narrow family candidate until exact display IP is known. xe3p_lpd_dmc belongs to display IP 3500 and is excluded. The 3.8.14 target declares only the legacy DMC path and no PTL GuC/HuC/GSC, so adding these bytes cannot establish PTL driver support. Exact G3/G3 Extreme PCI/display IP and runtime behavior remain unvalidated."
